A stop goes through a Thread capability without RIGHT_W,
so a capability that only lends a thread time stops it:
a call goes through only a capability with the rights its operation needs.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a call went through a capability without the rights its operation needs

diff --git a/kernel/syscall.c b/kernel/syscall.c
--- a/kernel/syscall.c
+++ b/kernel/syscall.c
@@ -982,7 +982,7 @@ static const struct op_shape op_shapes[OP_LIMIT] = {
     [OP_PROCESS_UNMOUNT] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A1),
     [OP_THREAD_CONFIGURE] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A123),
     [OP_THREAD_RESUME] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, 0),
-    [OP_THREAD_STOP] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, 0),
+    [OP_THREAD_STOP] = SHAPE(0, 0),
     [OP_THREAD_WATCH] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A1 | SHAPE_A2 | SHAPE_VARIES),
     [OP_THREAD_FAULT] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, 0),
     [OP_THREAD_READ_REG] = SHAPE(RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A1),
